<title>USA: Security Benefit offers value fund.</title>
<headline>Security Benefit offers value fund.</headline>
<dateline>TOPEKA, Kansas 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Security Benefit Group of Cos said it introduced the Security Value Fund.</p>
<p>The fund will be managed by Security's large-cap team, headed by Terry Milberger, with day-to-day management by Jim Schier.</p>
<p>Security Benefit has about $6.7 billion in total assets under management.</p>
